aiActivityAssemble.cs, the template maintainer's tool. A templates base holds two inputs with fixed names: aiTemplates-workFlow (the /bx-* commands, workflow skills and mother/ workflow files, the same for everyone) and aiTemplates-DE (an ecosystem's skills and activities), each a real directory or a link to a clone anywhere. The assembler deep-merges them into the base as relative links; a project initiated from the base links into it as before.
